# psycopg needs a time zone database, and Windows does not ship one, so this is
# a dependency of psycopg on win32 and invisible everywhere else. Compiling the
# lock on Linux or macOS therefore omits it, and Windows CI then fails
# --require-hashes on an unpinned transitive. Named here so it is pinned on
# whichever platform the lock is compiled from.
